:{"text":{"$i18n":"productKit.components.widgets.registry"},"tone":"muted","variant":"label"},"id":"widget-Table-from","type":"Text"}]},"type":"TableRow"},{"config":{},"id":"widget-TableRow","slots":{"cells":[{"config":{"mono":true,"text":"TableRow","tone":"highlighted","variant":"label","weight":"medium"},"id":"widget-TableRow-type","type":"Text"},{"config":{"mono":true,"text":"table-row","tone":"default","variant":"label"},"id":"widget-TableRow-component","type":"Text"},{"config":{"text":{"$i18n":"productKit.components.widgets.registry"},"tone":"muted","variant":"label"},"id":"widget-TableRow-from","type":"Text"}]},"type":"TableRow"},{"config":{},"id":"widget-TextInput","slots":{"cells":[{"config":{"mono":true,"text":"TextInput","tone":"highlighted","variant":"label","weight":"medium"},"id":"widget-TextInput-type","type":"Text"},{"config":{"mono":true,"text":"field","tone":"default","variant":"label"},"id":"widget-TextInput-component","type":"Text"},{"config":{"text":{"$i18n":"productKit.components.widgets.registry"},"tone":"muted","variant":"label"},"id":"widget-TextInput-from","type":"Text"}]},"type":"TableRow"}]},"type":"Table"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"RootShell"},"name":"Product Kit: Components","spec":{"accessibility":["The registry and the component table are named lists of rows whose first row is the column headings.","A layer is text in a badge, so it is never conveyed by color alone; source text is a named, focusable region that keeps visible focus."],"constraints":["Built only from Adapter Widgets (Stack, Text, Button, Badge, Icon, Table, TableRow, SegmentedControl, Segment, TextInput, Disclosure, CodeBlock, Alert, EmptyState, Skeleton); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","Every visible string is bound with $i18n except identities (component names, file paths, Widget types, schema fields and source text); en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","This View models the page content only; the Workbench shell is shown by the Workbench View.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A person opened the Product Kit page with ?section=components.","The base state is the dogfood Workspace as it is: the first 6 of its 19 registry components (the rest are below the first screen, so a Variant's block would not be) and all 17 mapped Widget types, for a member who holds product-kit.source.read.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the Workbench renders the live page and this View is its design reference."],"intent":"Show the Components section of the Workbench Product Kit page as built from Adapter Widgets only: the component registry as a table with browsing of one component's props, emits and source and the commands that copy it, and the Widget-type to component table. The Catalog block that closes the section is the Product Kit: Catalog View.","interactionRules":["The registry table lists each component with its layer, files, requires and packages; Browse opens the component below the table and Copy command copies the uiux components add command for the directory typed in Copy into.","Browsing reads the component's files for a member who holds product-kit.source.read, shows the props and emits each Vue file declares and its source as text, and offers the CLI and MCP commands that copy it; without the key the section names it and offers no Browse.","The component table is read-only and says it maps Widget types to components for Handoff and browsing only; it does not change how a Widget renders."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the four core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"7f3d7780-3cb9-4e57-8f0b-2e8d569905c1"}],"requirements":["01a11bb1-b918-7cb5-b581-a3fd3f647f09","01a11bb1-a1e5-70b6-a524-c1955425b1b2"]},"variants":{"component-browse":{"requirements":["01a11bb1-a376-719c-86e0-5f5e4d11cb8c"],"state":{"component-detail":{"visible":true},"component-source-loaded":{"visible":true}}},"component-browse-error":{"state":{"component-detail":{"visible":true},"component-source-error":{"visible":true}}},"component-browse-loading":{"state":{"component-detail":{"visible":true},"component-source-loading":{"visible":true}}},"components-empty":{"state":{"components-body":{"visible":false},"components-empty":{"visible":true}}},"components-no-read-key":{"state":{"comp-badge-browse":{"visible":false},"comp-breadcrumb-browse":{"visible":false},"comp-breadcrumb-item-browse":{"visible":false},"comp-button-browse":{"visible":false},"comp-checkbox-browse":{"visible":false},"comp-code-block-browse":{"visible":false},"components-no-key":{"visible":true}}}}}
